# Local-only scratch/data dirs (gitignored) that must NOT be uploaded to
# Vercel. Without this, `vercel --prod` from a working tree uploads them and
# Next.js output-file-tracing pulls them into the api/artifacts/[file] bundle,
# blowing past the 250mb serverless-function limit. Git-based deploys never
# see these (they're gitignored), so this only aligns CLI deploys with them.
csv-export/
csv-export.zip
.local-db/
